WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
PartiQ: an after-sales service platform, opening on its landing page.

00:04.000 --> 00:12.000
Dashboard, then the product catalogue of the supported brands.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Support tickets: the priority filter, then a ticket in detail with its status menu open.

00:18.000 --> 00:26.000
Knowledge base, then a manufacturer's technical sheet (PDF) is imported.

00:26.000 --> 00:31.000
The AI extracts brand, product, reference, spare part and specifications from the PDF.

00:31.000 --> 00:34.000
Asked about the TEMPOMATIC 4 before the sheet is confirmed, the assistant does not know it.

00:34.000 --> 00:43.000
Once confirmed, the product appears in the dashboard counts and the catalogue, with its spare part and document.

00:43.000 --> 00:48.000
Asked again, the assistant answers with the product's reference and a link to its technical sheet.

00:48.000 --> 00:58.922
Back through the knowledge base, tickets and dashboard.
